   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div>I have been in this group for sometime now and it was great to see lots of discussions happening here. However, I have very limited knowledge on R so could not run the camtrapR yet. I used other tools such as ReNamer to do preliminary analysis of camera trap data. </div><div>Therefore, if there is a step to step guide on how to keep the camera trap images, and the basic scripts for running camtrapR, it would immensely help me. Any help would be appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you,</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><font><font><font><b style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Letro (Mr.)</font></font></b></font></font></font></div><div><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><b style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\">Nature Conservation Division</b></font></font></font></div><div><b style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Department of Forests and Park Services</font></font></b></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29)\"><font><font>Ministry of Agriculture and Forests</font></font></span><br></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Taba, Thimphu, Bhutan</font></font></font></font></span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Phone: +975 02 325042 (O) Mobile: <a href=\"tel:+975%2017%2038%2059%2022\" value=\"+97517385922\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+97517385922</a></font></font></font></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">web: </font></font></font></font></span><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://leythro-darlo.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://leythro-darlo.blogspot.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460170147000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08-hsk-zRoHhWSWowqaMk1\">https://leythro-darlo.blogspot.com/</a></font></div><div><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><br><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
